# Provisional software-only Vectored-6DOF allocation from ROS 2 reference.
# Derived motor permutation is documented in docs/ardusub_migration/06_thruster_allocation.md.
# These settings do not enable an actuator port; do not use for commissioning.
FRAME_CONFIG 2
MOT_PWM_MIN 1300
MOT_PWM_MAX 1700
MOT_1_DIRECTION -1
MOT_2_DIRECTION -1
MOT_3_DIRECTION -1
MOT_4_DIRECTION -1
MOT_5_DIRECTION -1
MOT_6_DIRECTION -1
MOT_7_DIRECTION -1
MOT_8_DIRECTION -1
